# Copy this file to `.streamlit/secrets.toml` (local) or paste the same content
# into the host's "Secrets" settings (for example Streamlit Community Cloud).
# When `password` is set, the app asks for it before showing anything, which is
# required for any public deployment. Leave it unset for local-only use.
#
# A SHORT code is fine: after logging in, tick "记住这台设备" to get a link
# `https://<host>/?k=<password>` - save it to your phone's home screen and you
# never type the code again.
#
# Generate a 6-character code (no confusing 0/O/1/l/i) with:
#   python -c "import secrets; a='abcdefghjkmnpqrstuvwxyz23456789'; print(''.join(secrets.choice(a) for _ in range(6)))"

